# position snapshots contain live account data - never committed.
# The refresh scripts regenerate these from Plaid; deploys ship the
# working-tree copy, not a git-tracked one. This repo is public: committing
# a live snapshot would publish the book. The screener's position-awareness
# therefore travels as query params at call time (see docs/positions-feed.md),
# not as a file in git.
public/positions-live.json
public/positions-by-account.json
